cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the paper
  describing the method (preferred-citation).
type: software
title: "cmfqsar: Continuous Molecular Fields for 3D-QSAR"
abstract: >-
  An implementation of the Continuous Molecular Fields (CMF) approach to 3D-QSAR:
  molecular fields as sums of atom-centred Gaussians, kernels as analytic overlap
  integrals, kernel ridge regression, support-vector and Gaussian-process learners,
  molecular co-fields and their decompositions, with a desktop application, a
  command-line tool and a library.
